Returns the fields of a record as a new array of `[name, value]` pairs, in the same order as `Object.keys`.

@param value - One record or tuple. A record gives one pair per field in the order of that value's constructor literal. A tuple gives its positions with the names `"0"`, `"1"` and so on.

